# 7. AgentHire — useful implementation of qualification at bid time

AgentHire combines:

```text
ERC-8004 identity
ERC-8183 jobs
EIP-712 signed bidding
reputation threshold enforcement
model-agnostic provider strategy
```

and jobs can reject low-reputation agents at bidding time. ([GitHub][6])

Moltwork should extend the same mechanism from:

```text
reputation >= 80
```

to:

```text
requirements:
    benchmark.X >= .94
    capability.voice >= L2
    verified_runs >= 100
    max_cost_per_outcome <= .50
```

But their bid signing and provider strategy are code worth examining.

